      "payload": {
        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_return",
            "content": "In 2022, we repurchased and subsequently retired 161 million shares of our Class A common stock for an aggregate amount of $27.93 billion. As of December 31, 2022, $10.87 billion remained available and authorized for repurchases.",
            "entity_name": "META 2022 Class A Stock Repurchase Execution",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalReturn",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_return",
            "content": "In January 2023, an additional $40 billion of repurchases was authorized under this program.",
            "entity_name": "META January 2023 $40B Repurchase Authorization",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalReturn",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA",
              "update_type": "initiation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "We anticipate making capital expenditures of approximately $30 billion to $33 billion in 2023.",
            "entity_name": "META FY2023 Capital Expenditure Guidance",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_structure_event",
            "content": "In August 2022, we issued an aggregate of $10.0 billion principal amount of the Notes. The Notes were issued in four series, which mature from 2027 through 2062. Short-term and long-term future interest payments obligations as of December 31, 2022 are $411 million and $7.69 billion, respectively.",
            "entity_name": "META August 2022 $10B Senior Notes Issuance",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalStructureEvent",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "Our restructuring efforts to sublease, early terminate or abandon several office buildings under operating leases did not materially change our operating lease obligations.",
            "entity_name": "META 2022 Real Estate and Lease Restructuring",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "Cash provided by operating activities during 2022 mostly consisted of net income adjusted for certain non-cash items, such as $11.99 billion of share-based compensation expense, $8.69 billion of depreciation and amortization, and $3.56 billion of impairment for leases, leasehold improvements, and abandonment charges for data center assets related to our restructuring efforts.",
            "entity_name": "META 2022 Real Estate and Lease Restructuring",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          }
        ],
